    "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> 95% cotton and 5% spandex.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A cheerful matching tee for moms, dads, girls, and boys, easy for casual outings, birthdays, picnics, and family photos.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Print reference:</strong> Sunshine Stripe pairs a warm yellow base with red, blue, and navy horizontal stripes.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Short sleeves, crew neckline, relaxed straight tee shape, and one shared striped colorway for children and adults. Shorts, denim, shoes, hats, sunglasses, and picnic props shown in photos are styling only.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, turn inside out, line dry or tumble low, and avoid bleach.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 2 Years through Child 9-10 Years and Adult S through Adult 4XL.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<h3>T-Shirt Size Chart</h3>\n\n<p>Measure a T-shirt that already fits, then compare it with the garment measurements below. The chart is for the shirt only; bottoms and styling props are not included.</p>\n\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n\n<thead><tr>\n\n<th>Size</th>\n\n<th>Vendor Label</th>\n\n<th>Shirt Length (cm)</th>\n\n<th>Chest Width - Flat (cm)</th>\n\n<th>Chest Around (cm)</th>\n\n<th>Shoulder (cm)</th>\n\n<th>Sleeve (cm)</th>\n\n</tr></thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>39</td>\n<td>37</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>34.5</td>\n<td>12.5</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>42</td>\n<td>39</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>13.5</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>110</td>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>41</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>37.5</td>\n<td>14</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>120</td>\n<td>48</td>\n<td>43</td>\n<td>86</td>\n<td>39</td>\n<td>15</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>130</td>\n<td>51</td>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>40.5</td>\n<td>15.5</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>140</td>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>47</td>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>42.5</td>\n<td>16</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>150</td>\n<td>57</td>\n<td>49</td>\n<td>98</td>\n<td>44</td>\n<td>17</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult S</td>\n<td>S/160</td>\n<td>64.5</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>104</td>\n<td>49.5</td>\n<td>17.5</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult M</td>\n<td>M/165</td>\n<td>66.5</td>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>108</td>\n<td>51.5</td>\n<td>18</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult L</td>\n<td>L/170</td>\n<td>68.5</td>\n<td>56</td>\n<td>112</td>\n<td>53.5</td>\n<td>19</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult XL</td>\n<td>XL/175</td>\n<td>70.5</td>\n<td>58</td>\n<td>116</td>\n<td>55</td>\n<td>19.5</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 2XL</td>\n<td>2XL/180</td>\n<td>72.5</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>120</td>\n<td>57</td>\n<td>20.5</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 3XL</td>\n<td>3XL/185</td>\n<td>74.5</td>\n<td>62</td>\n<td>124</td>\n<td>58.5</td>\n<td>21</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 4XL</td>\n<td>4XL/190</td>\n<td>76.5</td>\n<td>64</td>\n<td>128</td>\n<td>60.5</td>\n<td>22</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Sunshine Stripe is a bright family matching tee that keeps everyone coordinated without feeling formal. The yellow base and classic horizontal stripes make the look playful, clear in photos, and simple to pair with denim, shorts, or casual skirts.</p>\n\n<p>Each selection is one T-shirt. Choose a child or adult size and add one tee for each person you want to match.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n<strong>One coordinated tee:</strong> Same striped short-sleeve shirt look for child and adult sizes.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Soft stretch blend:</strong> Cotton-spandex blend.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Family size range:</strong> Child 2 Years to Child 9-10 Years and Adult S to Adult 4XL.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Photo-ready color:</strong> Yellow, red, blue, and navy stripes make the matching look easy to spot.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Choose your fit:</strong> Compare the garment measurements in the size chart with a T-shirt that fits you well.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the child and adult sizes you need to build a sunny matching stripe look for everyday family memories.</p>",
